{"jsonrpc": "2.0", "id": 3, "result": {"content": [{"type": "text", "text": "domain of tbl:\n  x: u8, 0..255\n  requires 0 <= x < 3  (table index)\n  defined at 3 of 256 points\n  defined for: 0..2\n  undefined e.g. at x=3; x=4; x=5; x=6\n  over all 256 points of the domain\n"}], "structuredContent": {"id": 3, "ok": true, "cmd": "domain", "ucas": "tbl(x: u8) = [10,20,30][x]\ndomain tbl", "structured": true, "result": {"kind": "domain", "conditions": [{"kind": "requires", "text": "0 <= x < 3  (table index)"}], "defined_points": 3, "points": 256, "exhaustive": true, "c_ub_points": 0, "undefined_example": "x=3; x=4; x=5; x=6"}, "notes": [], "conditions": [], "checks": [], "files": [], "text": "domain of tbl:\n  x: u8, 0..255\n  requires 0 <= x < 3  (table index)\n  defined at 3 of 256 points\n  defined for: 0..2\n  undefined e.g. at x=3; x=4; x=5; x=6\n  over all 256 points of the domain\n"}, "isError": false}}
{"jsonrpc": "2.0", "id": 4, "result": {"content": [{"type": "text", "text": "domain of sh:\n  x: u8, 0..255\n  requires 0 <= x < 8  (shift amount; C UB otherwise)\n  defined at 8 of 256 points\n  defined for: 0..7\n  undefined e.g. at x=8; x=9; x=10; x=11\n  C undefined behaviour at 248 points, e.g. x=8\n  over all 256 points of the domain\n"}], "structuredContent": {"id": 4, "ok": true, "cmd": "domain", "ucas": "sh(x: u8) = 1 << x\ndomain sh", "structured": true, "result": {"kind": "domain", "conditions": [{"kind": "requires", "text": "0 <= x < 8  (shift amount; C UB otherwise)"}], "defined_points": 8, "points": 256, "exhaustive": true, "c_ub_points": 248, "undefined_example": "x=8; x=9; x=10; x=11", "c_ub_example": "x=8"}, "notes": [], "conditions": [], "checks": [], "files": [], "text": "domain of sh:\n  x: u8, 0..255\n  requires 0 <= x < 8  (shift amount; C UB otherwise)\n  defined at 8 of 256 points\n  defined for: 0..7\n  undefined e.g. at x=8; x=9; x=10; x=11\n  C undefined behaviour at 248 points, e.g. x=8\n  over all 256 points of the domain\n"}, "isError": false}}
